IMPORTANT POINT:
In projection ,i tried to find the data without filter query and just adding projection query,and the result is nothing,see below
db.data.find({name:1,_id:0})

so core reason is the find() method has two parameters:

query (first parameter): The filter condition to select which documents to find.

projection (second parameter): The rules for which fields to include or exclude in the results.

so if we want to project the data without filtering,use below syntax

db.data.find(
  {},           // FIRST ARGUMENT: Empty Query Filter (find everything)
  {name: 1, _id: 0} // SECOND ARGUMENT: Projection
)
